        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 458SQ, Simple Round Knob with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a>  collections door knobset has a traditional simple half round shape with a modern square rose back plate for contemporary homes that are in need of an update that will look great for years to come. The Omnia 458SQ features concealed screw mounting (hidden screws) and is available in 7 popular finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 458SQ Round Knob Square Rose Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 458SQ Round Knob Square Rose Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-9/16\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Round Knob Square Rose Knobset, Omnia 458SQ",
                "description": "The Omnia Prodigy collections door knobset has a traditional simple half round shape with a modern square rose back plate for contemporary homes that are in need of an update that will look great for years to come. The Omnia 458SQ features concealed screw mounting (hidden screws) and is available in 7 popular finishes.",
